2233
01:14:58,480 --> 01:14:59,360
to that pole over there.

2234
01:15:00,200 --> 01:15:01,920
What are you doing at the pole?

2235
01:15:02,520 --> 01:15:03,552
I can just lean on it,

2236
01:15:03,552 --> 01:15:04,480
and then I can do this.

2237
01:15:04,608 --> 01:15:06,880
I've never felt Paris was so beautiful.

2238
01:15:07,000 --> 01:15:08,960
You're too pretentious.

2239
01:15:09,680 --> 01:15:11,904
I've never thought
Paris was as beautiful as it is today.

2240
01:15:14,760 --> 01:15:15,264
Don't move.

2241
01:15:18,120 --> 01:15:19,040
Sorry, I mistook you for someone else.

2242
01:15:19,040 --> 01:15:20,000
It really doesn't look like you.

2243
01:15:21,520 --> 01:15:22,016
Come back.

2244
01:15:28,720 --> 01:15:29,320
Honestly,Don't say it,

2245
01:15:30,400 --> 01:15:32,600
if he's ten years older,

2246
01:15:33,120 --> 01:15:34,920
and 20 pounds heavier,

2247
01:15:34,920 --> 01:15:37,000
(I think it's okay)
he really looks like you.

2248
01:15:38,960 --> 01:15:39,600
I am...
[*Foreign language]

2249
01:15:39,600 --> 01:15:40,280
Hello.
[*Foreign language]

2250
01:15:42,040 --> 01:15:43,232
That little girl

2251
01:15:43,232 --> 01:15:44,680
also has a necklace.

2252
01:15:44,800 --> 01:15:45,800
How to wear it?

2253
01:15:45,800 --> 01:15:46,240
Necklace.

2254
01:15:46,720 --> 01:15:47,360
Okay, come on.

2255
01:15:47,360 --> 01:15:47,872
Let's do it.

2256
01:15:48,560 --> 01:15:49,960
You can wear it as a bow tie.

2257
01:15:49,960 --> 01:15:50,840
Why do I feel like

2258
01:15:50,840 --> 01:15:52,320
Yuning is going to choke me?

2259
01:15:53,640 --> 01:15:54,680
So romantic.

2260
01:15:55,240 --> 01:15:57,040
I can't stand it.

2261
01:15:58,144 --> 01:16:00,080
I feel like we're here to film a drama.

2262
01:16:00,608 --> 01:16:02,208
It's true. We're back on set.
